  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_723b75d9bee94175884fff02095caa51",
      "statement": "The AgentTeams dashboard consists of a Vite vanilla-JS SPA and a Node.js same-origin proxy that mediates all communication between the browser and the controller REST API and MinIO object storage.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://dashboard/README.md#L29-L36",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:dc9e53ed1ce27d287424ea9411239e443abf0c1f6eb79d6b0838934298bac5b3:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://dashboard/server/src/server.js#L1-L60",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:102b03fff074dcc784cfd61e46041816cbe43f0ce45e8d8d838719010d2346a1:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://dashboard/web/src/main.js#L1-L40",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4b6548fd4fd0ba47c6aad4fd60cd342abb326e3a503d8c6c5f49971c51c41e1e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fbd988d332e441879b89071c1c82a372",
      "statement": "The proxy is mandatory because the controller's REST API sets no CORS headers and requires a Bearer admin token on every request, which the proxy reads from a file and injects server-side.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://dashboard/README.md#L39-L51",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:db440ad64aec296e0fac6d1d0f46df00b757e003e2a328f2e7672776fa8f9422:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://dashboard/server/src/config.js#L214-L224",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fcbce5828bea63828f68ee411f2e7d6708a1dfb9d469f0d7852226a067563671:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://dashboard/server/src/controller-client.js#L30-L78",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e8ef6e19458f4775ecaa8164c9cf59812e8c5e176c24988d4db1dcc1486c1a63:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_239f889022c94d8a9ba0a2e2834ed4f0",
      "statement": "The scoped allowlist in `classify(method, pathname)` is a pure function that decides for every request whether it is allowed and where it should be routed, returning either a route decision or a 404/405 rejection.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://dashboard/server/src/allowlist.js#L59-L199",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:497b5000a506d01248a246100ff31b0514782822c8033427dca89613925ca257:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://dashboard/server/src/handler.js#L56-L63",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:90836cd784a1412fd90ee616f7078ccdf31f7b12ed44ca02d1311a449314b74d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e3f2efecd9db45e5b82b35cbc21f7195",
      "statement": "The allowlist defines exactly these route categories: GET controller passthrough for managers/teams/workers/manager-tasks/projects, GET MinIO for tasks and files under shared/agents roots, POST worker lifecycle writes (wake/sleep/ensure-ready), POST message injection for managers/teams, GET/POST/DELETE gateway provider management, and PUT model/provider assignment for workers/teams/managers.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://dashboard/server/src/allowlist.js#L60-L198",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bd222fbd38225520f195915663c8d1e3cb5af763c2ad888878119dc1576c2a24:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://dashboard/server/src/allowlist.js#L9-L39",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ae83abecf68b1fde48754aa4d9a534b052fba77dda79da9861e2f582595473cb:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7e451c3cf74e41d88f2e053218fd60b0",
      "statement": "Path traversal in MinIO routes is prevented by `normalizeMinioKey` which rejects `..` segments, embedded backslashes, null bytes, and segments that decode into traversal attempts, plus the allowlist constraining the root prefix to `shared/` or `agents/` only.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://dashboard/server/src/allowlist.js#L216-L237",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:66232cd70cd6068ce7251229889d0615533173d83139453634546a9bec8de2f0:"
        },
